<title>USA: Ohio $185 mln agency deal repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Ohio $185 mln agency deal repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co. said Tuesday it repriced Ohio Building Authority's $185 million bond deal, raising yields in several maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>STATE OF OHIO</p>
<p>(OHIO BUILDING AUTHORITY)</p>
<p>RE: $185,000,000*</p>
<p>STATE FACILITIES BONDS</p>
<p>1997 SERIES A</p>
<p>(HIGHWAY SAFETY BUILDING FUND PROJECT) AND</p>
<p>(ADULT CORRECTIONAL BUILDING FUND PROJECTS)</p>
<p>Verbal award.</p>
<p>Note price changes in 2002, 2003, 2005 thru 2007 and 2010. There will be balances in the following maturities:</p>
